	"notes": "CubeOffice 1.3.0 adds a template gallery. Creating a presentation now offers eight CubeOffice original templates, in English and Chinese, and you can still start from a blank slide; dismissing the picker leaves your open document untouched. The same templates are free to download from cubexp.com/templates. On Android, the app opens far faster and no longer shows a long blank screen while it starts. On phones and tablets, menus now open as bottom sheets that are easier to reach one-handed. AI and command-line document actions behave consistently, and prompt colours in the Markdown editor are fixed.",
